        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Skadi.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've fallen, Skadi. The old you could've made chunks out of them with just a touch.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mister Jos\u00e9, I am not that bloody.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$farce_intro",
        "key": "$farce_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_181"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hard to say. You've changed, then. You even gave them a chance to escape.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Possibly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_181"
    },
    {
        "text": "What wind blew you back here again? Why were they waiting to spring you\u2014something to do with me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$farce_intro",
        "key": "$farce_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_181"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hear you're not in our line of work anymore. Joined some... pharma company? What are you shirking good, decent work for to tromp around these rundown outskirts again?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're well-informed, Mister Jos\u00e9. This time I need you to help me out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_181"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.6,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "The old man licks his rolling paper, and pulls out some second-rate tobacco from his pouch.",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Several years have come and gone. Here I thought you'd folded, seeing as you went through plenty of Kazimierz bounty hunters. This far out from Kazimierz, and I could still hear word of what you'd been up to.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "text": "Always thought you only knew how to make big ruckuses.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you've been quiet as this now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "text": "You came roadrollering in all the way from Minos country like a tow truck, just to find me? Go on, then, tell me what you want.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "I need to get to Sal Viento.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_181"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sal... Viento?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't tell me. Even you've never heard of the place?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_181"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I've heard. Out of all us information peddlers, only I must've heard. The question's you\u2014what makes you want to go there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's nothing there anymore. Few decades ago... close to nothing left after.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "text": "So close to such a vast patch of ocean, and you think anything'd be left? No better than bare frames left, letting the wind and all through.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "text": "Many bounty hunters wanting to get up to those abandoned cities, just like beastlings pouncing on a rotting burdenbeast corpse.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "text": "All of them thinking there's still meat they can pick off. They don't know whatever they swallow there might as well be a batch of poison.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "text": "Iberia. All of them think this unspeaking Iberia's just like Kazimierz and Gaul, treasure all over the map.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah, there's nothing there at all. When a place has nothing at all, it's likelier than all it could have anything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "So do you tell those bounty hunters anything?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_181"
    },
    {
        "text": "If they ask me to sell info, I'll sell it. As far as ones like me go, whether those folks come back or don't, it's all business.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fact is, they don't come back at all. Not one ever comes back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "text": "Two weeks ago, a team came to me. Lackeys of the 'Daggerhorn.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "text": "He had equipment leagues better than all these runts lying around. Very experienced too. Brought more than ten with him. Still haven't seen them again yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "text": "Very many wonder about where they went. They could've been caught by the Penal Battalion, or it could've been the Iberian Defensa's doing, but I've heard tell of a different possibility.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "text": "Over there be... monsters.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_181"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or it was the Inquisition that got 'em. I don't know what's a more wretched end.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Monsters or people, my sword draws little distinction. There are only those who block my way, and those who don't.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_181"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, alright. You can't be going to Sal Viento for a holiday, that much's for sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "I need to find someone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_181"
    },
    {
        "text": "What poor bastard has your wrath this time?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "This time's different. It's my... It's someone I knew from before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_181"
    },
    {
        "text": "Before you even knew me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Much before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_181"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here I thought they'd all left. Or died. At least, that's what you told me back in those days.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's why I'm searching. There's a few things I need to figure out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_181"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've been searching for quite some years, yeah?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "text": "That whole ruckus from last time couldn't have been for any knights' treasure's sakes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "You told me before. People ought to move forward.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_181"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you bring a treasure map with you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_181"
    },
    {
        "text": "There're many, some of them even old hands. They travel the barrens, traveling and traveling, and forget where they wanted to go, or what they were even looking for.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "text": "They just keep on traveling. They don't know starvation, they don't know exhaustion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "text": "Until the barrenlands do them in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "They were too weak.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_181"
    },
    {
        "text": "Weak? No matter how much stronger, a hunter could still never conquer the boundless barrenlands. So many hunters die for no sure reason out on the road, and don't even know what they're searching for come their deaths\u2014that's not an ending that suits you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why are you telling me all this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "As if I've never told you before? They wouldn't rival even the tiniest \u00c6gir machine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_181"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're strong. So did you save my son's life?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_181"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't say sorry! I'm not trying to flog you here. I'm trying to get you thinking. It's you who hasn't forgiven yourself, not me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "text": "I only regret that I didn't break his legs, stop him following an old pap\u00e1 in his old tracks. Nothing to do with you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "text": "You say you came from the sea. I've never heard of any other sea than the one in Iberia. You're someone I don't know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "text": "So what about you? Is there no one you don't know?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because that's the kind that killed my son. Someone you don't even know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's the sort of thing I'm afraid of.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_181"
    },
    {
        "text": "Never mind it. At least the people you talk about wouldn't spend day and night plotting to kill me. What are you thinking of doing in Sal Viento?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have a friend who's been taken there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_181"
    },
    {
        "text": "Strange, that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take this. Map.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright. What do I need to give you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_181"
    },
    {
        "text": "Give me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "You sell intel. One thing for another. You've given me information, I'll give you what you need.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_181"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Flicks cigarette ash)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me think... That year you brought my young Juan's body back, you handed him to me. Head and arms all still attached to him. So, now we're even.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mister Jos\u00e9, my greatest thanks.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll be going, then. Take care.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_181"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop! Are you in such a hurry to get yourself killed?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_181"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey. Tell me\u2014has anyone ever said anything like that to you before?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_181"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then you need somebody to tell you well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're strolling straight into an Iberian city dressed in all your bounty hunter clothes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_181"
    },
    {
        "text": "You really haven't changed, Skadi. Here I am parching my mouth, and I might as well be the wind for all the good telling you anything does.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Iberian Defensa'd have you ten times over for looking like that!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "text": "And how much time are you ready to waste on them? How much longer can the person you're looking for wait? Iberians aren't like these lousy bounty hunters. They're not that easy to break clean of.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "You want to suggest something to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_181"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can lend you a few things. Take this harp.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Harp?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_181"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can you play? I remember you played before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_181"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good, all the better. Would be fine if you couldn't, long as you pulled off the act.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "text": "Change into these too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "What clothes are these? They're very strange.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_181"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whether you're used to them isn't the point. Iberians are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_181"
    },
    {
        "text": "From now on, you're the wandering singer Skadi.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go where you want now, singer. Follow the map, go by the waterways, and you'll get there soon enough. This you can do, \u00c6gir.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Farewell, Mister Jos\u00e9.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_181"
    },
    {
        "text": "Skadi!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't you die out there. You have to die with someone, someone you know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Jos\u00e9"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
