        "b": 255,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What are these things... they\u2014they're tangling me, they won't let go! Chopping them apart doesn't even work. Is the entire coast all monsters like this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey\u2014get away, get the hell away!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "I wouldn't have come if I goddamn knew! Ja pierdol\u0119, 'Yellow Smog,' bastard, if only you weren't so useless to get hoodwinked back then, would I still be stuck picking up garbage out here?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Skurwysyny, if I'm not dead by the end of this I'll wish I was! Goddamned Iberia! Country of the actual goddamned!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
