    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_007"
    },
    {
        "text": "What\u2014What the hell was that? Turning them all to paste in one shot?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huff... huff. Whatever it was, at least it lets me live another day\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
