        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_183#3",
        "blackstart": 0.2,
        "blackend": 0.4,
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You. You're not leaving.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_007"
    },
    {
        "text": "And\u2014And who are you? Where the hell does Iberia get all these freaks from?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_183#3",
        "blackstart": 0.2,
        "blackend": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "Second time. Iberia forbids the spreading of rumors. The next you move to speak, be much more careful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_007"
    },
    {
        "text": "What? Look at that getup, that weapon\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Holy shit. You, you're... that's it, I'm done for, I'm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
