    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 255,
        "g": 255,
        "b": 255,
        "fadetime": 0.1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_182#1",
        "blackstart": 0.4,
        "blackend": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "Gather your scraps. When the Commander asks you a question, it's not to hear you blather, outsider.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_007"
    },
    {
        "text": "Question? What question? I swear, honor, I wouldn't dare ask questions... I've got no questions, I guarantee...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "I beg you, honor, I don't want... Don't take me... I'd be better off if I just died!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_182#1",
        "blackstart": 0.4,
        "blackend": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "Casting yourself into the sea in front of me? Do you still think it's not too late?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_007"
    },
    {
        "text": "That sword... my hand... too close... wargh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_182#1",
        "blackstart": 0.4,
        "blackend": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, have you regained some sense? You outsiders are as good as insects in the weeds, hearts avaricious and blackened, yet always so quick to fall to pieces.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_007"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh, ah... I'm not running anywhere, honor, I'll tell you anything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_182#1",
        "blackstart": 0.4,
        "blackend": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "Good. I do not like repeating my questions. This will therefore be the final time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "What did you see on the coast?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_007"
    },
    {
        "text": "I, I... *cough* *cough*... I saw monsters.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_182#1",
        "blackstart": 0.4,
        "blackend": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "How many of you came?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_007"
    },
    {
        "text": "Originally twelve... uh, counting the guide, we're thirteen total.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_182#1",
        "blackstart": 0.4,
        "blackend": 0.6,
        "name2": "avg_npc_183#3",
        "blackstart2": 0.2,
        "blackend2": 0.4,
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Commander. He's not lying. I've found the corpses myself along the coast.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_007"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sob*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_182#1",
        "blackstart": 0.4,
        "blackend": 0.6,
        "name2": "avg_npc_183#3",
        "blackstart2": 0.2,
        "blackend2": 0.4,
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey. What use will crying be for you now? If it weren't for you all intruding, they wouldn't have sought you out. When you violate the law, you should anticipate the costs.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "That said, twelve have died... They've been proliferating in number, all along the way here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_182#1",
        "blackstart": 0.4,
        "blackend": 0.6,
        "name2": "avg_npc_183#3",
        "blackstart2": 0.2,
        "blackend2": 0.4,
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "They can't have gone too far from their nest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_182#1",
        "blackstart": 0.4,
        "blackend": 0.6,
        "name2": "avg_npc_183#3",
        "blackstart2": 0.2,
        "blackend2": 0.4,
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This serves to show your judgment was sound. The closer one approaches, the more numerous they are. There is surely something amiss going on in that town!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_182#1",
        "blackstart": 0.4,
        "blackend": 0.6,
        "name2": "avg_npc_183#3",
        "blackstart2": 0.2,
        "blackend2": 0.4,
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You may depart.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_182#1",
        "blackstart": 0.4,
        "blackend": 0.6,
        "name2": "avg_npc_183#3",
        "blackstart2": 0.2,
        "blackend2": 0.4,
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "And this fellow? He has seen much he shouldn't have.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_007"
    },
    {
        "text": "Spare... Spare me! I've told you everything I can! Sir, Commander, your honor... ohh, mama...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_183#3",
        "blackstart": 0.2,
        "blackend": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "What... did you see?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_007"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
